<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle steady - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said slaughter steers and heifers were moderately active. Both classes were steady.</p>
<p>Steers - part load choice blacks predominantly 3 near 1325</p>
<p>lbs 67.50. High select and choice 2-3 1200-1350 lbs</p>
<p>64.00-66.50. Select and choice 2-3 1100-1300 lbs 61.00-64.00.</p>
<p>Select 1-2 58.00-61.00.</p>
<p>Heifers - high select and choice 2-3 1050-1200 lbs 63.00-</p>
<p>65.50, few 66.00. Select and choice 2-3 1000-1125 lbs</p>
<p>60.00-63.00. Select 1-2 58.00-60.00.</p>
</text>
